+# Upstream contracts
+
+Pinned copies of the HTTP contracts of the services the gateway calls, as of the version the gateway was last
+checked against. The gateway's clients (`src/upstream/`) implement exactly these; update a copy together with its
+client when the upstream team announces a change.
+
+| File                  | Service                  | Version |
+| --------------------- | ------------------------ | ------- |
+| `orders.openapi.yaml` | estate-quellbrook-orders | 0.1.0   |
